    "chunk_text": "Vesak Poya on 30 May: Govt.\n\nThe Government has decided to observe Vesak Full Moon Poya Day on 30 May, with Vesak Week scheduled from 27 May to 2 June.\n\nCabinet Spokesman and Minister Dr. Nalinda Jayatissa addressing the weekly post-Cabinet meeting media briefing noted that the decision was taken following a request by the Chief Prelates.\n\nAccordingly, the day after Vesak Poya, 31 May, will also be declared a public holiday, the Minister noted.\n\nHe said a Gazette notification formalising the declaration will be issued by the Public Administration Ministry."
  },
