    "chunk_size_bytes": 569,
    "chunk_text": "In parallel, the Government has also approved a comprehensive program to rebuild and repair religious sites damaged by the cyclone, ensuring the continuity of worship and community activities. The effort will be coordinated by the Buddha Sasana Religious and Cultural Affairs Ministry together with the Department of Religious Affairs.\n\nFinancial assistance of up to Rs. 7.5 million will be provided for full reconstruction, while up to Rs. 5 million will be allocated for partially damaged sites. Minor damages will also be addressed through targeted restoration work."
