    "chunk_text": "RDA joins \u201cVehicle Testing Can Save Lives\u201d campaign\n\nThe \u201cVehicle Testing Can Save Lives\u201d awareness project, conducted by the Automobile Association of Ceylon under the grant program of the F\u00e9d\u00e9ration Internationale de l\u2019Automobile, was successfully completed with the distribution of 72,000 leaflets at highway entrances.\n\nDevapriya Hettiarachchi, Secretary, AA Ceylon handed over the leaflets to T. Paskaran, Chairman of the Road Development Authority. Also present at the launch were Director General\n\nH. H. N. A. Hettiarachchi, Deputy Director General (Expressway Operations) R. A. D. Kahatapitiya, and Deputy Director General K. Chandrakumara.\n\nCEAT Kelani launches GRIPP X5 and ZOOM X5 premium motorcycle tyres for Sri Lankan roads\n\nDoc990 introduces cashless channeling with Softlogic Life for corporate policyholders\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
