    "date_str": "2026-05-01",
    "description": "Is it a \u2018Mayday!\u2019 for the NPP\u2019s  slow slide into systems failure?",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Is-it-a-Mayday-for-the-NPP-s-slow-slide-into-systems-failure/4-791341",
