    "chunk_id": "2026-05-01-dailyftlk-942f575e-0000",
    "chunk_index": 0,
    "language": "en",
    "md5": "881dc516db1896361cf94c1f626bb7fb",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1926,
    "chunk_text": "Pan Asia Bank equips customers with solutions to face energy crisis\n\nRecurring fuel-related challenges in Sri Lanka, including supply uncertainties, rising fuel costs and global energy volatility have brought untold hardship on the people in the country. Armed with the mission to support customers transitioning towards more affordable and reliable transportation options, Pan Asia Bank has been driving innovation to offer both mobility and energy independence. Anticipating the growing challenges surrounding fuel availability and energy costs in the country, Pan Asia Bank took proactive steps to offer customers a forward-looking solution. Its EV Plus Leasing seamlessly combines electric vehicle (EV) leasing with a pre-approved solar energy facility for customers increasingly seeking practical and sustainable alternatives to conventional mobility. The EV Plus Leasing bundled solution is anchored to an EV lease, complemented by a pre-approved energy loan or lease of up to Rs. 1,000,000 for a home solar system. This enables customers to invest simultaneously in clean transportation and renewable energy through one streamlined and coordinated process.\n\nDesigned to cater to both personal and business users, the facility provides flexibility in acquiring brand-new, reconditioned or registered electric vehicles, addressing a wide range of customer requirements. In addition, customers have the option to take over or refinance existing EV leases from recognised financial institutions, further enhancing convenience and accessibility. A key strength of EV Plus lies in its integrated structure. Customers benefit from coordinated approvals and smooth disbursement, eliminating the need to manage multiple financing arrangements. The solar component is flexibly structured to suit individual needs, while competitive rates and tailored repayment options ensure affordability and alignment with customer cash flows."
  },
