    "chunk_text": "This tragic forgetting brings into focus a profound truth my friend Karl, an artist, once shared with me: the real war we are waging is against nature. It is a relentless assault against the birds, the bees, and the gracious forest. And until we stop this war against the earth, we will never stop any of the other wars we wage against each other.\n\nBut they have won absolutely nothing. You cannot claim victory when your beaches are landfills and your neglected infrastructure is a death trap. You cannot call it progress when the majestic elephants, the ancient  palu trees, and the coral reefs that breathe life into this island and all of humanity are slowly choking to death on the fumes of our own contempt.\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
